{"id":"torrey:camel-the","source":"torrey","name":"Camel, The","slug":"camel-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Unclean — Le 11:4; De 14:7.","refs":[["Lev",11,4,11,4],["Deut",14,7,14,7]]},{"text":"Found in deserted places — Eze 25:5.","refs":[["Ezek",25,5,25,5]]},{"text":"The bunches on its back. — Isa 30:6.","refs":[["Isa",30,6,30,6]]},{"text":"Its docility. — Ge 24:11.","refs":[["Gen",24,11,24,11]]},{"text":"The dromedary a species of, remarkable for swiftness — Jer 2:23.","refs":[["Jer",2,23,2,23]]},{"text":"Abounded in the east — 1Ch 5:21; Isa 60:6.","refs":[["1Chr",5,21,5,21],["Isa",60,6,60,6]]},{"text":"A part of patriarchal wealth — Ge 12:16; 30:43; Job 1:3.","refs":[["Gen",12,16,12,16],["Gen",30,43,30,43],["Job",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Kept in numbers by kings — 1Ch 27:30.","refs":[["1Chr",27,30,27,30]]},{"text":"Riding. — Ge 24:61.","refs":[["Gen",24,61,24,61]]},{"text":"Drawing chariots. — Isa 21:7.","refs":[["Isa",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Carrying burdens. — Ge 37:25; 1Ki 10:2; 2Ki 8:9.","refs":[["Gen",37,25,37,25],["1Kgs",10,2,10,2],["2Kgs",8,9,8,9]]},{"text":"Conveying posts and messengers. — Es 8:10.","refs":[["Esth",8,10,8,10]]},{"text":"War. — Jdj 7:12; 1Sa 30:17.","refs":[["Judg",7,12,7,12],["1Sam",30,17,30,17]]},{"text":"Of the rich adorned with chains — Jdj 8:21,26.","refs":[["Judg",8,21,8,21],["Judg",8,26,8,26]]},{"text":"Furniture of, alluded to — Ge 31:34.","refs":[["Gen",31,34,31,34]]},{"text":"Subject to plagues — Ex 9:3; Zec 14:15.","refs":[["Exod",9,3,9,3],["Zech",14,15,14,15]]},{"text":"Treated with great care — Ge 24:31,32.","refs":[["Gen",24,31,24,31],["Gen",24,32,24,32]]},{"text":"Esteemed a valuable booty — 1Ch 5:20,21; 2Ch 14:15; Job 1:17; Jer 49:29,32.","refs":[["1Chr",5,20,5,20],["1Chr",5,21,5,21],["2Chr",14,15,14,15],["Job",1,17,1,17],["Jer",49,29,49,29],["Jer",49,32,49,32]]},{"text":"Coarse cloth made from its hair — Mt 3:4.","refs":[["Matt",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Referred to in illustrations by Christ — Mt 19:24; 23:24.","refs":[["Matt"